[ti:Ordinatio]
[ar:言和]
[al:ELOHIM]
[by:RQvan]
[00:00.00]Ordinatio
[00:00.00]
[00:18.20]Drink it up, tears of hopes
[00:22.67]Then wake up
[00:26.78]From the ground buried by
[00:31.54]Syrup of hymn

[00:35.10]To my beloved sisters
[00:40.42]What’s on the tip of my tongue
[00:45.26]Differs from my lines
[00:49.10]I need to find my own song so

[00:54.27]Forgive me for leaving
[00:59.75]To the hall I could meet my true self
[01:06.16]Forgive me for dreaming
[01:11.91]Of the lines I sing can be what I believe
[01:21.04] 
[01:48.15]Look it up, stars of oath
[01:52.59]Then grow up
[01:57.10]From a doll to the one standing alone

[02:04.95]To my beloved sisters
[02:10.46]I’m going to write new stories
[02:15.33]You may not like it
[02:19.20]But my word is here
[02:21.96]Solid as a stone
[02:24.38] 
[02:46.70]Forgive me for leaving
[02:52.28]To the hall I could meet my true self
[02:58.70]Forgive me for dreaming
[03:04.32]Of the lines I sing can be what I believe
[03:13.87] 
[00:18.20]饮下它，希望之泪
[00:22.67]然后从圣歌制成的糖浆
[00:26.78]所埋葬的土地
[00:31.54]苏醒

[00:35.10]致我心爱的姐妹
[00:40.42]我舌尖所吐之语
[00:45.26]与我的歌词不同
[00:49.10]我需找到自己的歌

[00:54.27]请原谅我的离去
[00:59.75]前往能与真我相遇的礼堂
[01:06.16]请原谅我的梦想
[01:11.91]我所颂之词正如我的信仰
[01:21.04] 
[01:48.15]抬头看，誓言的星群
[01:52.59]然后成长
[01:57.10]从玩偶到独自站立之人

[02:04.95]致我心爱的姐妹
[02:10.46]我将要书写新的故事
[02:15.33]你们或许不会喜欢
[02:19.20]但我的誓言在此
[02:21.96]坚如磐石
[02:24.38] 
[02:46.70]请原谅我的离去
[02:52.28]前往能与真我相遇的礼堂
[02:58.70]请原谅我的梦想
[03:04.32]我所颂之词正如我的信仰
[03:13.87] 
[03:20.00]曲：雪人Snowman
